mutant: m081_migrate_guard_ignored_at_startup
target: internal/jetstreamd/migration.go
failure-mode: |
  A local process starts ingest without reading the handoff guard. After a
  handoff committed, a restart of the source ingests again while a
  disaggregated pod leads the archive: two writers, and the source's new
  seqs collide with nothing anyone reads.
expected-detection: |
  TestMigration_CrashSeams/after-migration-done restarts the source on a
  pending guard after the done commit and requires its seq/next unchanged;
  TestMigration_LocalToDisaggregated restarts a handed-off source and
  requires the same.
expected-tier: migration
tiers: migration

